# Every `safe` grade in the repository (tests/app_safe_grades.rs). One line per grade: `file :: action`.
# A line is added only after somebody has read the handler: `safe` lets the built-in companion run it through `app_action`,
# so it must change nothing the person keeps, start nothing and send nothing. Read for #1313 round 5 (19 Nov) and round 6.

